[E0414] Error: cannot borrow `growing` as `&var` while a `for` loop walks it
    ╭─[ err/182_walked_container_changed/main.wip:11:9 ]
    │
 10 │     for value in growing.values() {
    │                  ────────┬───────
    │                          ╰───────── walked here; the loop's binding refers to its elements
 11 │         growing.put("b", value)
    │         ───┬───
    │            ╰───── borrowed here
    │
    │ Note: a `for` binding refers to the element itself, so what the loop walks must not change until the loop ends
────╯
